#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:1
msgid "SoC execution budgets"
msgstr "SoC 执行预算"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:3
msgid ""
"The authored assembly and immutable resolved IR select exact controller "
"modes, capacities and clock profiles. This document explains how to review "
"their execution costs; it is not another capability registry or configuration"
" input. The [derived capability matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) owns the"
" maintained selection projection. Product scheduling and overload policy stay"
" external."
msgstr ""
"作者装配与不可变解析 IR 选择精确控制器模式、容量及 clock profile。本文件说明如何审查执行成本，不是另一能力 registry "
"或配置输入。[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)持有维护中的选择投影。产品调度和过载策略留在外部。"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:9
msgid "Work, time and completion"
msgstr "工作量、时间与完成"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:11
msgid ""
"A finite work count is not a measured time bound. Bootstrap loops use "
"explicit poll limits because the monotonic clock may not yet exist. Runtime "
"absolute deadlines belong to the current boot clock domain. IRQ delay, DMA "
"arbitration, bus stalls, notification latency and service intervals require "
"measurements for the exact firmware and hardware under load."
msgstr ""
"有限工作次数不是实测时间上限。启动 loop 使用显式 poll limit，因为单调时钟可能尚未存在。运行时绝对 deadline "
"属当前启动时钟域。IRQ 延迟、DMA 仲裁、总线 stall、通知延迟及 service 间隔须对精确固件／硬件负载测量。"

#: docs/design/soc-execution-budgets.md:17
msgid ""
"Each selected mode must document its maximum IRQ work, task service work, "
"critical-section scope, caller storage and terminal predicate. A drain "
"deadline limits the period before quarantine; it never authorizes releasing "
"borrowed memory. The executor must keep calling service/recovery until "
"hardware, IRQ, queues and observers actually withdraw their references."
msgstr ""
"每种所选模式须说明最大 IRQ 工作、任务 service 工作、critical-section 范围、调用方存储及终止谓词。排空 deadline "
"限制进入隔离前时间，绝不授权释放借用内存。执行者必须继续 service/recovery，直到硬件、IRQ、队列及观察者真正撤销引用。"

